        <summary>Do you work with businesses outside Belgium?</summary>
        <div class="faq-answer"><p>Absolutely. While we're based in Kortenberg, Belgium, we serve SMBs across the Benelux, DACH region, UK, and internationally. All communication is in English, and we work across time zones.</p></div>
      </details>
    </div>
  </div>
